<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{% block title %}The League{% endblock %}</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ root }}assets/img/favicon.png">
<link rel="preload" href="{{ root }}assets/fonts/saira-condensed-700.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" href="{{ root }}assets/fonts/chivo-mono-var.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ root }}assets/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<!--
THESIS: The league as the house — every stat is a line posted on the board,
with receipts; refuses the KPI-card dashboard arrangement.
OWN-WORLD: matte near-black board (#0a0a0d) ruled into sections by thin brass
rails; Saira Condensed signage caps; Chivo Mono tabular numerals in amber and
silver; league purple fields for the house's own rows; the Trojan crest as
house mark. Recognizable with all content removed: a black board of railed
sections awaiting numbers.
STORY: a league member lands mid-argument, finds the posted number in
seconds, screenshots the receipt, wins the chat.
FIRST VIEWPORT: board masthead (crest, THE LEAGUE, season status line), then
the season's posted lines open the board; the argument-settling links sit in
the first section.
FORM: Las Vegas sportsbook tote board; candidate 5 of 7 on the ordered list;
seed key f00tba11.
FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the
finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md.
-->
<header class="masthead">
  <a class="crest" href="{{ root }}index.html">
    <img src="{{ root }}assets/img/favicon.png" alt="" width="44" height="44">
    <span class="wordmark">The League</span>
  </a>
  <p class="house-line">{% block houseline %}Est. 2021 · Downers Grove North · twelve chairs, one trophy{% endblock %}</p>
</header>
<nav class="board-nav" aria-label="Site">
  {%- for href, label, key in [
    ("index.html", "Board", "board"),
    ("seasons.html", "Seasons", "seasons"),
    ("managers.html", "Managers", "managers"),
    ("h2h.html", "Head-to-Head", "h2h"),
    ("records.html", "Records", "records"),
    ("draft.html", "Draft & Keepers", "draft"),
    ("trades.html", "Trades", "trades"),
    ("champions.html", "Champions", "champions"),
  ] %}
  <a href="{{ root }}{{ href }}"{% if active == key %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ label }}</a>
  {%- endfor %}
</nav>
<main>
{% block content %}{% endblock %}
</main>
<footer class="rail-footer">
  <p>Every number on this board is recomputed from Sleeper's records. Argue with the data, not the bookkeeper.</p>
  <p class="fine">{% if meta and meta.generated_utc %}Lines posted {{ meta.generated_utc }} · {% endif %}Six seasons on file.</p>
</footer>
<script src="{{ root }}assets/js/tables.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
